msgid "Chassis_Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt"
msgstr "Pojistka"

msgid "Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt"
msgstr "Pojistka"

msgid "Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt_descr"
msgstr ""
"Just look at this Pojistka—clean lines, tight systems. Feels like someone "
"wired a full lab into a gun and a hull. We rolled out thinking we’d stop "
"Krieger’s time experiment—and instead landed in his twisted loop. A trap. "
"Same ground, same fight, over and over. But I’m not just surviving—I’m "
"hunting. This machine talks to me. I pick a ridge, lock a target, and let "
"these smiling shells fly. He thinks the loop will break us? Let him. I’ve "
"got a tank and all the time in the world to tear his plan apart."

msgid "Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt_short"
msgstr "Pojistka"

msgid "Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt_short_special"
msgstr "Major modernization of the main battle tank"

msgid "Turret_1_Cz04_T50_51_Waf_Hound_3DSt"
msgstr "Pojistka"

msgid "_100mm_Prurazny_vz_50_WT"
msgstr "Silver Bullet"

msgid "_100mm_Prurazny_vz_50_WT_descr"
msgstr "Pride of the Alliance armorers"

msgid "_100mm_Prurazny_vz_50_WT_long_special"
msgstr ""
"Each overloaded Generator will charge Silver Bullet with Plasma. The more "
"Charges, the more damage Plasma causes. Shoot when the Blitzträger's shield "
"is down for maximum damage."

msgid "_100mm_Prurazny_vz_50_WT_short_special"
msgstr "Additional damage with Plasma"
